{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 ARROW WORLD A Logic Puzzle Game About Cardboard Boxes Living in a Logistics Warehouse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cardboard as the Main Character?</strong> In 'ARROW WORLD', you become a warehouse designer, guiding moving cardboard boxes called &quot;Hakoby&quot; to collect ordered items and reach the goal. They never stop moving! Guide these constantly moving cardboard boxes to the goal by skillfully placing conveyor belts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872770/extras/e0cb253ac2fbb750d4784af1c7b63b36.poster.avif?t=1772197238\" width=574 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872770/extras/e0cb253ac2fbb750d4784af1c7b63b36.webm?t=1772197238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872770/extras/e0cb253ac2fbb750d4784af1c7b63b36.mp4?t=1772197238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Simple Yet Deep</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are easy. Just change the direction of conveyors and place them. But Hakoby never stops moving, so if you make one placement mistake... they'll get lost in no time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd04 Infinite Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Conveyors can be placed <strong>infinitely!</strong> This creates diverse solutions. Go for the shortest route, or create a safe detour. Build your own perfect logistics system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872770/extras/2e0dac8622f6551744ac71d948ff0df8.poster.avif?t=1772197238\" width=290 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872770/extras/2e0dac8622f6551744ac71d948ff0df8.webm?t=1772197238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872770/extras/2e0dac8622f6551744ac71d948ff0df8.mp4?t=1772197238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1 Non-Stop Thrills</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other warehouse puzzle games, this one's different! Since Hakoby keeps moving constantly, you need to make <strong>real-time decisions</strong> while adjusting routes. Sometimes the conveyors you placed become your enemy, causing unexpected troubles...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce6 Adorable Cardboard World</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the world of Hakoby moving around a logistics warehouse, a puzzle experience awaits where you can fully utilize logical thinking and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become an excellent warehouse designer? Or will you become a troubled manager who gets the cardboard boxes lost?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hello Arrow World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872770/f6b38a271c13e889ff0e9eca4cdfd87f4366ef59.jpg"},{"name":"Conveyor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872770/6e708b82761c180119facd58fceb78323f3541f5.jpg"},{"name":"Cardboard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872770/36990760ad6170645d575943ba458527794004a5.jpg"},{"name":"watch it all fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872770/a7ed6d259a4eaf8d5e2143c70980282e9c105f6f.jpg"},{"name":"blind to the world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872770/30c62f1f23cc3c9950ad8e1bbfba617f23506e32.jpg"},{"name":"I can't see anything","path":"http